    "id": "ex03-tab",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "03 Param read set",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Separate Param read and Param set (echo-confirm) demos — not chained, so a read PARAM_VALUE cannot race a set confirmation.",
    "env": []
  },
  {
    "id": "ex03-comment",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "ex03-tab",
    "name": "Param read and set (separate injects)",
    "info": "Two independent demos. Read requests SYSID_THISMAV (Send). Set writes RTL_ALT with Send & confirm so the echo matcher waits for that set's PARAM_VALUE — never wire read continue into set. Edit the set inject payload value for your vehicle. Set Connection and Vehicle target before deploy.",
    "x": 220,
    "y": 40,
    "wires": []
  },
